## Effective Use of globs

### Specific Patterns

```yaml
globs:
  - "themes/hapas/src/pages/**/*"           # All page components
  - "themes/hapas/src/pages/all/*.tsx"      # Only global components
  - "extensions/*/src/**/*"                 # All extensions
  - "scripts/*.js"                          # Root-level scripts only
```

### When to Use Broad globs

```yaml
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"    # Use sparingly - only for universal TypeScript rules
  - "**/*.scss"   # Only for universal styling rules
```

### Multiple Patterns

```yaml
globs:
  - "themes/*/src/pages/**/*"     # Covers all themes
  - "packages/*/src/modules/**/*" # Covers all packages
```

